  "gap": "The isolated provenance helper #1705 intentionally has no existing callers. Later actual caller integration changes three tools that are byte-pinned by 66 references in 61 immutable declarations. A test-only exact predecessor witness is still absent for these new changes; existing readers for other historical transitions do not cover them.",
