      "scripts/solo-provenance-declared-source.test.mjs"
    ],
    "design": [
      "Retain exactly the three verified predecessor source bodies once and the finite 61 declaration identities plus their 66 exact affected references.",
      "Implement a pure, test-only declaredProvenanceTool(witnessBytes, manifestPath, manifestBytes, ref) reader. Pin witness byte length/SHA-256 before parse, exact source revision/tree, allowed tool set, declaration byte identity and exact reference tuple; return only the corresponding verified predecessor source bytes.",
      "Reject unknown declaration paths, altered declaration bytes, forged or extra reference fields, wrong tool source, duplicate records and changed witness identity. Do not provide a generic current-path fallback or modify production stale-source refusal.",
      "Add direct focused *.test.mjs controls for all 66 recorded references, each of the three tools and the rejection boundaries, with no historical acceptance result promotion.",
      "Do not route any current test reader, native consumer, measurement caller or workflow through the adapter in this isolated stage. Later integration will deliberately choose the affected test readers."
    ],
    "preserved": [
      "All 61 historical declarations and their non-tool protocol/workload/cap/threshold fields",
      "The current runner, observer and qualifier",
      "Original trace-v2 workflow, historical package and source identities",
      "#1703 fourteen-file overhead repair and its acceptance gate",
      "Existing source selectors and 17 native/two Pages sparse owners"
    ]
  },
  "dependencies": {
